*>   1998-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 540
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0018.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY INT0018C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> APPLIED INTEREST RATE
    05 INT-RATE           PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM SET-TERM-RATE
    DISPLAY "INT-RATE=" INT-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SET-TERM-RATE.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        *> SHORT TERM DEPOSIT RATE
        WHEN DEPOSIT-BAND-1-3
            MOVE 0.0300 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN DEPOSIT-BAND-4-12
            MOVE 0.0375 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN DEPOSIT-BAND-13-36
            MOVE 0.0450 TO INT-RATE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 0.0150 TO INT-RATE
    END-EVALUATE.
